# sgo.build (schema: see the sgola tree's core/sgo.build). wataclient is the
# PORTABLE client core: a liblink library over core + json, with a default
# package and no @goexport — its whole surface is consumed only from Sgola
# (wata-fb links it whole-program, resolving it as a source sibling in this
# repo). Add `publish` back if it ever gains a fetchable remote; `sgo emit`
# then produces the payload-only module tree consumers take from pkg/mod.
mode liblink
emitname wataclient
optreport
